<title>UK: HALIFAX SAYS NO IMMEDIATE RATES ANNOUNCEMENT.</title>
<headline>HALIFAX SAYS NO IMMEDIATE RATES ANNOUNCEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Plc said on Thursday it would not be making an immediate announcement on its mortgage rates following the Bank of England's decision to raise its key money market rate by a quarter point to 7.0 percent.  </p>
<p>Halifax was &quot;reviewing the situation but don't intend to make any immediate announcement,&quot; the bank told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
